 rest of the wall of sound as needed. Vocalist John Ross's voice and lyrics are the icing on the cake, with a fulfilling emotional resonance. The album is full of thought-provoking comments on modern ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.getalternative.com/alternatives-top-50-releases-2017-3/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d255\"},\"ref\":\"d255\",\"snippet\":\" ... The coins also need to be used to complete a certain part of the chapter including 100 coins to build a relationship with another character or learning to duel.\\n\\nHouse Cup[]\\n\\nThe player will win or lose House points throughout the game which could depend on their choices ... \",\"title\":\"https://harrypotter.fandom.com/wiki/Harry_Potter:_Hogwarts_Mystery\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d256\"},\"ref\":\"d256\",\"snippet\":\" ... The firm maintained that he was fired purely for his performance.<a href=\\\"#cite_note-100\\\">[100]</a> He sued the firm, in one of the first <a href=\\\"/wiki/AIDS_stigma\\\" class=\\\"mw-redirect\\\" title=\\\"AIDS stigma\\\">AIDS discrimination</a> cases to go to a public hearing ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Timeline_of_HIV/AIDS\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d257\"},\"ref\":\"d257\",\"snippet\":\" ... That's what the Dragon Ball Fanon Wiki is for. -- Nonoitall (talk) 23:14, 20 November 2008 (UTC)\\n\\nahh forget it you dont get it at all. (Goten.GT1 00:32, 21 November 2008 (UTC))\\n\\nDragon Ball SF Magnas are on Youtube. Nikon23\\n\\nCharacters that appear in Dragon ... \",\"title\":\"https://dragonball.fandom.com/wiki/Talk:Dragon_Ball_AF\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen