tion_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d263\"},\"ref\":\"d263\",\"snippet\":\" ... However, one of the nominees for Best Picture had grossed over $100 million before the nominations were announced (compared with none from the previous year). The combined gross of the five Best Picture nominees when the Oscars were announced was $188 million with an average gross of $37 ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/81st_Academy_Awards\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d264\"},\"ref\":\"d264\",\"snippet\":\" ... Thomas Stockmann (Boyd Gaines) discovers a toxic secret that threatens the health of his entire community. The doctor expects to be hailed as a hero, but his brother, Mayor Peter Stockmann (Richard Thomas), believes the information will destroy the town, forcing the men into a passionate confrontation of ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.manhattantheatreclub.com/past-productions/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d265\"},\"ref\":\"d265\",\"snippet\":\" ... Matt, Richard, Stan, and Dennis Mersino; many nieces, nephews, cousins and friends who will miss her dearly.\\n\\nJoan was preceded in death by her husband, Richard, and grandson, Nicholas Miller, 1 sister and 3 brothers.\\n\\nFamily suggests memorial donations be made to the American Lung Association.\\n\\nVisitation for ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.blackburnchapel.com/obituary-archive\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d266\"},\"ref\":\"d266\",\"snippet\":\" ... her younger sister Madison discover they have an older sister named Macy. Soon after, they start manifesting powers and are told they are witches who must protect the world from demons in this reboot of the WB series from Jennie Snyder Urman, Amy Rardin and Jessica O'Toole ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.businessinsider.com/best-worst-tv-shows-of-the-2010s-according-to-fans\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d211\"},\"ref\":\"d211\",\"snippet\":\" ... Dan Harmon\\n\\nBirdperson, Kevin, Mr. Marklovitz, Davin, Ice-T, Dr. Glip-Glop, Nimbus\\n\\nDan Harmon is the co-creator of Rick and Morty alongside Roiland. The two share a long history going back to the Channel 101 days. While both Roiland and Harmon are skilled storytellers, Harmon has ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.denofgeek.com/tv/rick-and-morty-voice-actors-guide/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"8301a45b7c53c3b84be56b4c0e3b3288e193e027a6e17267a67535bf06d7884c\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"a6f403e07fd8ae4e86d14c2bffb44fa75734fc9c9e892939b813e68ae39a9703\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Jessica Harmon Niylah The 100 sister Richard\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_688553ae0ea94b89b6c8f926"},{"content":"I have strong evidence for the \"real-life relative plays unrelated character\" clue (Richard Harmon & Jessica Harmon on The 100). Now I need to verify the remaining clues: Murphy's marriages (3-4 times), only one child surviving, and Richard Harmon's height (1.65-1.70m). Let me read the Screen Rant page for the sibling clue and search for the Murphy character page and Richard Harmon's height.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"ref\": \"d14\", \"start\": 3000, \"length\": 3000}","name":"read"},"id":"call_f6c2c0af01c54d0fac53d23c","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Richard Harmon height cm 5'6\", \"John Murphy The 100 Emori married child\", \"The 100 Murphy Emori baby child survives series\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_66308a801ee64933b11c2cab","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"evidence\":{\"document\":\"d14\",\"document_chars\":9101,\"end\":6000,\"kind\":\"raw_evidence\",\"ref\":\"e2\",\"sha256\":\"296ede205a2fe113473e85be08b84f0d6833191551136843c6bff169eec542b7\",\"snapshot\":\"a531c0a6be82cbe578781b28cb207ff02e87008856d5212ec2eab3fae2afe076\",\"start\":3000,\"text\":\"ured together as a musical act. It's safe to say that the sisters' careers have been closely related to one another, and that was also true of their work on Hellcats alongside Ashley Tisdale, another former Disney Channel star.\\n\\nThe show followed Aly's character as she used her gymnastic skills to become part of a rather fiercely competitive and drama-filled cheerleading squad. The show only lasted a single season, but that gave Aly and AJ plenty of time to be on screen with one another, and kept their sisterly bond a featured aspect of both of their careers.\\n\\nJeffrey Dean Morgan And Hillarie Burton\\n\\nJeffrey Dean Morgan has made appearances in pretty much every popular television show. Currently, he's Negan, the big bad on The Walking Dead, and in that role, he's managed to call up a lot of menace from inside him. Morgan has also made appearances on the CW in Supernatural.\\n\\nOn that show, Morgan played the role of Sam and Dean Winchester's father -- the man who inspired them to begin their life hunting demons. Morgan's wife Hillarie Burton was also a regular on the CW, playing Peyton on One Tree Hill.\\n\\nThe two have never acted on the same CW show, but both were on the network at roughly the same time.\\n\\nOf course, that was long before they were married in 2014, so maybe the CW was one of the first things they talked about.\\n\\nJessica And Richard Harmon\\n\\nActors who are siblings in real life are commonly cast to play siblings on television. After all, that's the best way to make it seem like the relationship is an authentic one. In the case of Jessica and Richard Harmon, though, the siblings actually play unrelated characters in the world of The 100.\\n\\nJessica plays Niylah, a character who shows up in the third season and has been with Clarke on a couple of different occasions. Richard played John Murphy, a recurring character during the show's first two seasons who was bumped up to a major role during the third season.\\n\\nWhatever went on behind the scenes that led both of these siblings to star on the show is unclear, but it must be nice for them both to have a friendly face on set.\\n\\nJensen Ackles And Danneel Ackles\\n\\nSupernatural is one of the longest-running shows in television history, and Jensen Ackles has been one of the show's stars for its entire run. Although Ackles's co-star Jared Padalecki met his wife on the set of Supernatural, things happened a bit differently for Ackles and his wife Danneel. Jensen and Danneel started dating in 2009 and were married in 2010, but it wasn't until 2018 that Danneel showed up on Supernatural, playing a faith healer.\\n\\nInterestingly, Danneel once tweeted that if the show made it to its 13th season, which is currently airing, that would be when she decided to guest star. It turns out, that's exactly what happened.\\n\\nIn their private life, Jensen and Danneel live in Dallas, Texas with their daughter and a pair of twins.\\n\\nKatie Cassidy And Patrick Cassidy\\n\\nYou're far more likely to know Katie Cassidy than you are her\"},\"executed\":true,\"next_start\":6000,\"ok\":true,\"previously_received\":false}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_f6c2c0af01c54d0fac53d23c"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d231\"},\"ref\":\"d231\",\"snippet\":\" ... Between 3 and 5 September, outward movement of the former N crater rampart reached 10.4 cm/day at one site and 6.5-7 cm/day at three others. Thrusting along the most active fault about 100 m SW of the composite dome accelerated to 23 cm ... \",\"title\":\"https://volcano.si.edu/volcano.cfm?vn=321050\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d232\"},\"ref\":\"d232\",\"snippet\":\" ... 115.8, 89.9, 35.5, 13.1, 5.6, 2.8, and 1.2. It is based on the 30m … aspect csp elevation elevation-topography ergo geophysical -\\n\\nGlobal Aboveground and Belowground Biomass Carbon Density Maps\\n\\nThis dataset provides temporally consistent and harmonized global maps of aboveground and ... \",\"title\":\"https://developers.google.com/earth-engine/datasets/catalog\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d214\"},\"ref\":\"d214\",\"snippet\":\" ... Only Otonashi, Kanade and Yuri had their heights explicitly mentioned. Everyone else is a close estimation of their height. All heights were originally in metric but converted to feet and inches.\\n\\n- ↑ 4.0 4.1 4.2 Episode 6\\n\\n- ↑ 5.0 5.1 Episode 7\\n\\n- ↑ Another Epilogue\\n\\n- ↑ Angel ... \",\"title\":\"https://angelbeats.fandom.com/wiki/Kanade_Tachibana\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d241\"},\"ref\":\"d241\",\"snippet\":\" ... Danny Trejo – 5 feet 6 inches\\n\\nDanny is among the most famous short celebrities with a height of 167 cm (5' 6\\\") tall. The legendary actor has starred in several films and television shows, including:\\n\\n- Runaway Train\\n\\n- Desperado\\n\\n- Con Air\\n\\n- Reindeer\\n\\n- Games Grindhouse\\n\\n27. Dustin Hoffman – 5 feet ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.legit.ng/ask-legit/1505676-short-actors-30-famous-celebrities-6-feet/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d267\"},\"ref\":\"d267\",\"snippet\":\" ... Regionally, the standard deviation of male heights was largest in North America and Australia, at 7.49 cm, and smallest in East Asia, at 6.37 cm. The pattern was the same for women, with 6.96 cm in North America and Australia, and 5.74 cm in ... \",\"title\":\"https://ourworldindata.org/human-height\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d268\"},\"ref\":\"d268\",\"snippet\":\" ... The New Interpreter's Bible falls under 6.4.9-10 and 6.2.21-23, which cannot be perfectly harmonized. The following represents therefore my own best (albeit fallible) judgment. The text in red appears on the authority of 6.2.20-22 rather than 6.4 ... \",\"title\":\"https://spu.libguides.com/citations/cite_sbl\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d269\"},\"ref\":\"d269\",\"snippet\":\" ... x 28 in.) was shipped as checked baggage on 34 commercial flights.\\n\\n| Commercial airlines drop height | Number of drops |\\n\\n|---|---|\\n\\n| 0–15 cm (0–6 in.) | 799 |\\n\\n| 15–30 cm (6–12 in.) | 27 |\\n\\n| 30–46 cm (12–18 in.) | 14 |\\n\\n| 46–60 cm (18–24 in.) | 1 |\\n\\n| 60 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.canada.ca/en/conservation-institute/services/conservation-preservation-publications/technical-bulletins/effective-packaging-transport-artwork.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d270\"},\"ref\":\"d270\",\"