ition : Sweeper,\\n\\nHeight : 181 cm\\n\\nMajor Club : Bayern Munich,\\n\\nCaps : 103 Games (\",\"title\":\"http://xtrahistory.blogspot.com/2013/01/All-Time-World-XI.html\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d276\"},\"ref\":\"d276\",\"snippet\":\" ... District Judge Melinda Harmon in Houston approved the deals with the Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce, JPMorgan Chase & Co. and Citigroup Inc.\\n\\nIn a pres\",\"title\":\"https://securities.stanford.edu/filings-case.html?id=102098\"},{\"navigation_seen\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d275\"},\"ref\":\"d275\",\"snippet\":\" ... Table 2.\\n\\n| Included (n = 159) | Excluded (n = 49) | p | |\\n\\n| Age (years ± SD) | 23.6 ± 4.5 | 22.7 ± 3.9 | 0.40 |\\n\\n| Body height (cm ± SD) | 169.1 ± 5.5 | \",\"title\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11841719/\"}],\"consecutive_repeat_rounds\":0,\"contract\":{\"enabled\":true,\"gap_state\":true,\"guided_read\":true,\"recovery_rounds\":2,\"repeat_threshold\":2,\"repetition\":\"bounded\",\"reuse_results\":true,\"version\":\"gap-workflow-v1\"},\"instruction\":\"Use the current missing relation to choose a real next action. Page-name search is not page reading; cached is not proof of progress.\",\"last_new_navigation_source_round\":15,\"last_new_raw_source_round\":14,\"previous_gap_judgments_not_verified\":[],\"recovery_decisions_used\":0,\"stage\":\"normal\"},\"retriever_capabilities\":{\"boolean_operators\":false,\"kind\":\"sqlite-fts5-bm25\",\"negative_result\":\"no hit for this expression is not proof that the fact is absent\",\"phrase_quotes\":false,\"query_rule\":\"lowercase; regex word extraction; first-occurrence deduplication; OR of quoted individual tokens\",\"ranking\":\"SQLite bm25(search), ascending; docid tie-break; unchanged from q26 LocalIndex\",\"scope\":\"fixed local corpus; not live web\",\"site_filter\":false,\"title_kind\":\"stored URL, not an extracted page title\",\"warning\"